Hey, Morgan.

49
00:04:10,921 --> 00:04:13,821
How come you're such an expert on all that crap?

50
00:04:24,236 --> 00:04:26,821
It's quite a coincidence that you guys came
through El Paso...

51
00:04:26,921 --> 00:04:28,621
...right when I started hitchhiking.

52
00:04:28,919 --> 00:04:31,421
Like it was perfectly timed.

53
00:04:32,971 --> 00:04:34,221
Like it was meant to be.

54
00:04:34,321 --> 00:04:36,271
These things don't happen by accident.

55
