Great.

85
00:06:27,721 --> 00:06:28,621
What did you say?

86
00:06:28,771 --> 00:06:31,671
I don't remember. Sorry. Fried brain cells...

87
00:06:32,455 --> 00:06:35,382
Two hundred pounds of marijuana? Does that jog
your memory?

88
00:06:35,570 --> 00:06:37,938
Don't listen to that asshole.

89
00:06:37,963 --> 00:06:39,321
Honey, please.

90
00:06:39,371 --> 00:06:41,801
Tell me we didn't go to Mexico to buy marijuana.

91
00:06:43,488 --> 00:06:45,167
We didn't go to Mexico to buy marijuana.

92
00:06:46,755 --> 00:06:48,621
Honey, what's wrong?

93
00:06:48,721 --> 00:06:51,862
I'm not a drug dealer, okay?

94
00:06:52,863 --> 00:06:56,258
- Tell me how much you love me. How much?
- This much.

95
00:06:56,266 --> 00:06:58,498
- Just this much?
- Yeah. That's it.

96
00:06:59,228 --> 00:06:59,971
Give me a kiss.

97
00:07:02,933 --> 00:07:06,222
You can't drive like that. Watch the road.

98
00:07:07,293 --> 00:07:08,669
- Watch out!
- Shit!

99
