You almost ran her over!

100
00:07:18,671 --> 00:07:21,271
What the hell was she doing walking in the
middle of the road?

101
00:07:28,871 --> 00:07:29,718
Idiot!

102
00:07:31,455 --> 00:07:32,771
Hello?

103
