107
00:07:44,981 --> 00:07:46,121
Kemp, stop the van.

108
00:07:47,393 --> 00:07:48,771
Screw that! There are cops around here!

109
00:07:48,821 --> 00:07:51,171
We've still got a long way to go. Where are you
