Okay, we can't leave her like this.

116
00:08:10,608 --> 00:08:12,321
Let us help you, okay?

117
00:08:12,782 --> 00:08:13,671
Come on.

118
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:17,157
- Come on, it's okay.
- All right.

119
00:08:19,737 --> 00:08:22,267
All right, ma'am, we'll give you a ride. Where
do you want to go?

120
00:08:23,053 --> 00:08:26,521
