You're going the wrong way.

129
00:09:26,636 --> 00:09:28,819
Stop! You're going the wrong way!

130
00:09:37,535 --> 00:09:39,321
- Jesus.
- I can't go back there.

131
00:09:39,421 --> 00:09:41,421
Don't make me go back.

132
00:09:42,365 --> 00:09:45,235
- I'm not going back.
- Back where?

133
00:09:53,621 --> 00:09:55,621
He's a bad man.

134
00:09:56,221 --> 00:09:58,021
A very bad man.

135
00:10:05,756 --> 00:10:07,221
He's a bad man.

136
00:10:08,619 --> 00:10:09,931
- Holy God!
- Wait!

137
00:10:13,921 --> 00:10:15,691
You're all gonna die.

138
00:10:16,190 --> 00:10:17,094
Let go! Put that down!

139
00:10:24,170 --> 00:10:26,991
- No!
- Oh, my God!

140
00:10:31,155 --> 00:10:33,948
- Let me out!
- Oh, my God!

141
00:10:56,699 --> 00:10:58,619
I'm okay. I'm okay.

142
00:11:02,081 --> 00:11:03,908
- Oh, my God!
- Calm down!

143
00:11:04,269 --> 00:11:07,410
It's over. It's okay. It's over.

144
00:11:07,666 --> 00:11:09,271
