151
00:11:32,687 --> 00:11:34,042
She needed help!

152
00:11:34,605 --> 00:11:37,341
- What kind of help did we give her?
- Leave her alone.

153
00:11:38,566 --> 00:11:39,486
Damn it!

154
00:11:42,671 --> 00:11:44,399
I don't understand.

155
00:11:45,871 --> 00:11:49,221
Why did she do that? And why did she pick us?

156
00:12:03,266 --> 00:12:04,351
