That's one of the worst ideas I've ever heard.

160
00:12:15,971 --> 00:12:17,121
Are you kidding me?

161
00:12:17,171 --> 00:12:20,823
Hello, cops? The crime scene isn't our van.

162
00:12:20,824 --> 00:12:22,821
And please ignore the drugs.

163
00:12:22,921 --> 00:12:26,621
We found them by accident. They must belong to
some partygoers.

164
00:12:30,391 --> 00:12:32,565
Keep your damn voice down.

165
00:12:33,896 --> 00:12:35,321
Calm down, calm down.

166
00:12:35,421 --> 00:12:36,821
Damn it.

167
00:12:44,405 --> 00:12:45,721
Are you gonna listen to him?

168
00:12:46,321 --> 00:12:47,571
What the hell are you doing?

169
00:12:55,250 --> 00:12:55,944
It's over.

170
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:59,615
Kemper, you can't just throw it all away!

171
