Ma'am, we need to report a suicide.

187
00:15:12,533 --> 00:15:14,671
When something like that happens...

188
00:15:14,771 --> 00:15:18,630
...people realize how crazy the world is.

189
00:15:19,321 --> 00:15:19,871
That's true.

190
00:15:21,206 --> 00:15:22,909
Can you call the sheriff?

191
