It'll cost you a dime.

192
00:15:33,851 --> 00:15:35,021
Want some pork?

193
00:15:40,635 --> 00:15:41,574
Shit.

194
00:15:49,374 --> 00:15:50,521
Big brothers.

195
00:15:54,685 --> 00:15:56,388
I feel disgusting.

196
