211
00:16:48,021 --> 00:16:50,663
Is it normal for girls to blow their brains out
in this goddamn town?

212
00:16:50,664 --> 00:16:54,465
Calm down, let me handle this. Excuse me, but
I...

213
00:16:54,483 --> 00:16:55,721
Ma'am, I don't understand.

214
00:16:55,871 --> 00:16:58,121
Why can't the sheriff come here?

215
