Nobody made her blow her brains out in our van.

239
00:19:46,592 --> 00:19:47,321
My van.

240
00:19:54,021 --> 00:19:55,321
I vote we leave her here.

241
00:19:56,471 --> 00:19:57,476
Pig.

242
00:19:58,770 --> 00:20:01,049
All right, then. Two votes.

243
00:20:02,193 --> 00:20:03,771
We only need one more.

244
00:20:04,008 --> 00:20:04,921
Kemper?

245
