Let's get out of here.

246
00:20:08,321 --> 00:20:09,793
Kemper, please.

247
00:20:18,471 --> 00:20:19,650
She's already dead.

248
00:20:23,321 --> 00:20:25,121
I don't think it matters where we leave her.

249
00:20:26,421 --> 00:20:29,742
- It matters to me, if that counts for anything.
- Erin, look...

250
00:20:29,789 --> 00:20:32,771
That girl had parents. Somebody must be looking
for her. We can't...

251
00:20:33,236 --> 00:20:36,442
