253
00:20:50,771 --> 00:20:52,521
Maybe this isn't the right mill.

254
00:20:56,621 --> 00:20:57,714
Unbelievable.

255
00:20:59,484 --> 00:21:02,002
This is a joke. There's nobody here.

256
00:21:02,321 --> 00:21:04,021
There's no sheriff here.

257
